title: "Electrochemical Engineering Toolkit"
abstract: "Python tools for electrochemical engineering: impedance inverse modelling with model selection and parameter uncertainty, electrolyser stack and electrothermal simulation, vanadium flow battery crossover and pumping, corrosion-rate estimation, Tafel analysis, and validated processing of measurement files."
